{
  "about": "Get-ChatqDueTime (src/watcher.ps1): the latest of the lane's limit plus 60 s, its next overload check, notBefore, deferUntil and retryAt that is still ahead, or null for now; and Update-ChatqBlock's skip rule: a lane rescanned at most every 10 minutes unless forced. Lanes are case-blind hashtable keys. A job is read from data/queue, so a zoneless stamp is UTC to 5.1 and the zone's wall clock to pwsh 7.",
